From 657068e0e938a7fefb07623175a64d87dc14d453 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tobias Fischer <info@tobiasfischer.info>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 10:12:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] gui: Qt 6 API fixes (QSignalMapper/QComboBox/QButtonGroup
 signals, QMatrix, grabWindow)

String-based SIGNAL() connections to signals removed in Qt 6 compile but
silently fail to connect at runtime:
- QSignalMapper::mapped(QString|int) -> mappedString/mappedInt
- QComboBox::currentIndexChanged(QString) -> currentTextChanged
- QSpinBox::valueChanged(QString) -> textChanged
- QButtonGroup::buttonClicked(int) -> idClicked
QMatrix -> QTransform, QPixmap::grabWindow -> QWidget::grab.
---
 gazebo/gui/AlignWidget.cc                    | 2 +-
 gazebo/gui/ApplyWrenchDialog.cc              | 2 +-
 gazebo/gui/ConfigWidget.cc                   | 8 ++++----
 gazebo/gui/VideoRecorder.cc                  | 2 +-
 gazebo/gui/building/BuildingEditorPalette.cc | 2 +-
 gazebo/gui/building/EditorView.cc            | 4 ++--
 gazebo/gui/model/CollisionConfig.cc          | 6 +++---
 gazebo/gui/model/GraphView.cc                | 4 ++--
 gazebo/gui/model/JointCreationDialog.cc      | 4 ++--
 gazebo/gui/model/ModelCreator.cc             | 4 ++--
 gazebo/gui/model/ModelEditor.cc              | 2 +-
 gazebo/gui/model/VisualConfig.cc             | 4 ++--
 gazebo/gui/plot/ExportDialog.cc              | 2 +-
 13 files changed, 23 insertions(+), 23 deletions(-)

